  "faq2Answer": "That is to be decided amongst yourselves. Currently, HerStay does not receive or manage any money from its users. It is highly recommended that you draw up a written agreement before making any payments. As stated in the terms and conditions HerStay is not liable for any payments or agreements and is only intended to connect users with similar travel lodging preferences.",
